{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fb/mkz3fnvb3loeakcn1fh115xdn9z97j0.mp3","text":"建筑设计，工业研发，科学研究，只要博士想得到的，我都能做到。","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/7f6inaf3ssgl88aoj6bdd8f5yemekoa.mp3","text":"工程部的人每次都不认可我的提案，是不是不喜欢我啊，怎么办......对了博士，你去代我提交下这份改进意见吧！就这么定了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2c/7o9dua54y9b6mucognshtq92970vodc.mp3","text":"莱茵生命里像我这样的工作室还有很多啦，但别的工作室三周才能完成一半的任务，我一周就能搞定。这可不是在吹牛哦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/21x4ymtz69zbnll8h1kcfa5g29ktz0e.mp3","text":"我做研究的时候千万别打扰我，我是会让咪波咬你的！我自己也会！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ed/2bjffwd6nbtm6w2cj8yh11jjwl9o04h.mp3","text":"晚上总是会很有灵感呢......但又......非常困！不，不行了，枕头在哪......我要休息一下......","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/8sn5zkkcxc0boi2zksww0c6vh2t50y2.mp3","text":"嗯？你想问为什么它们叫咪波？咪波是它的启动音效嘛，我觉得挺合适的。不像？那你可以摁下这个开关——等等！不是那个！那是自毁———呜啊啊啊，快跑！！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/qfqtaoiy5benvh6epgwjxj5kdaovjhl.mp3","text":"刚刚走过去的......是赫默吧。如果那时候......喔，抱歉，保密协议还没过期，我不该多嘴的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/iu5mswr4wwhgipny4c3e6a11ij3q7uu.mp3","text":"闲下来就只会感到空虚呢......工程师就是这样的人啦。博士也会无所事事吗？不会？","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/35/cmvzulbt9nimeit5hx3heznfkej2lyg.mp3","text":"博士，我能申请——不是！不用十平米！上次是我不对，这回——三平米就够了！别，别跑啊博士！一平米实用科研面积也行！求你了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/5dsua3u6pqt9u9zv62rp4vnh3ecsnmt.mp3","text":"哈啊......咖啡机在哪里......呼，博士你也要来点儿吗","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ac/3j61eaqghd3uvw6sgpcfd1e19092uff.mp3","text":"莱茵生命所属，鲁特拉工作室，竭诚为您服务。是的，没有其他成员，我一人就是整个工作室。很厉害吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/1j1vzrad70c86bba7ndx0x6xbsgmok1.mp3","text":"这个结构——有些意思，我得研究一下。","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/cfjhwmdwxavi6jgmbscnira4sxyydwm.mp3","text":"这次涨薪可真是及时，我又能升级一下设备了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/eiqfiqebfnqbx5pvv2dx12qzpa628jh.mp3","text":"我向您保证过一定能出成果，现在，怎么样，是不是很令人满意呀~","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/1ghyll1pffa690dnngwzdn3skqggpdt.mp3","text":"咪波们，该上场咯！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/90pxsu9n1u3amatur0iux0b1rjxhqp6.mp3","text":"要同时指挥大家和咪波，就算是我也有点手忙脚乱......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/73/6349x3x7od6dma0nb4haz3qboj2fu49.mp3","text":"这次也能得到良好的实验数据吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/pbzp5revicloef7t1qhzdazvzbu199r.mp3","text":"上吧咪波，给敌人看看我们莱茵生命的技术力！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/9glmszwvfyd30513axt1xuq6zdvfng8.mp3","text":"呜哇！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/o64h8aslp6aunay5bn5kclotggya0z9.mp3","text":"小心，小心一点！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/try1sgekfw0ji1s9vw3dc2m8x2p9ss3.mp3","text":"轻拿轻放！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/2lab10wi6i0bugfvc6fjgkzyejypg09.mp3","text":"精密仪器是很贵重的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/4i3mccofq7xmr00fmrho5g5f9gf5p37.mp3","text":"去吧，咪波三号！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/87/fed85vj8axq1mvfil88cpmlfo9sbewd.mp3","text":"咪波，咬他！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a6/55guu9bmtr5qzb1wj4n20vm2lvg1c40.mp3","text":"身体破损的话，再造一个就好了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/snggcnfada344ubffc2c1ldlnkd09sd.mp3","text":"我的咪波们可不仅仅是机械那么简单！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/90/t9stgzsolhzw5ht597xnb5yszwiqng0.mp3","text":"来~咪波！给大家跳支舞庆祝一下！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/312s5cxi14uaj2y8n1zn0v8xvx9slft.mp3","text":"嗯，就这样轻轻松松碾压敌人吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/q3q95kt49zl9zy93cmppeszf0ic7lq2.mp3","text":"设备稍微有些缺损，修理一下就能继续工作了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/sweodj02o3tpszfn2pgg17s31zzseyj.mp3","text":"不！咪波——！......只，只能再造几台身体了......","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/ngnwvnl6r2c4zc3bg3vhrsnet9mv6sl.mp3","text":"我想要个新的工作室了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/mrc90ehwiam2z531gzmym7zezjeb5h5.mp3","text":"呜哇！我还在工作中啊！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ae/l5h5qmj2se1935z5c19dou6cc0zzkdn.mp3","text":"博士，让我摸摸你的头，会很有灵感的！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/rgqu59r34q5ve4g13bvbirq5r1glhoq.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/nfumuxn2ccv13aasbz554382wpeop3d.mp3","text":"呼啊，博士，新年快乐！我可真是太喜欢新年了，就算错过了饭点出门，外面也还是会有很多饭菜可以吃！要是每天都能这样就好——啊！咪波！我会按时吃饭啦，痛！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/imiwn5nk8skxyef4ezeo8drg165uq3p.mp3","text":"博士！你好！","alt":"voice_cn/char_242_otter/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/12/q2moiap2k0d70auggujdpj1zdghyovm.mp3","text":"建筑设计，工业研发，科学研究，只要博士想得到的，我都能做到。","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/38/00wlmgunc3mxqqvds5adwlzsa99ndsb.mp3","text":"工程部的人每次都不认可我的提案，是不是不喜欢我啊，怎么办......对了博士，你去代我提交下这份改进意见吧！就这么定了！","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/83/4mliz3o8l15ft4ag6s2tpvtherdiksq.mp3","text":"莱茵生命里像我这样的工作室还有很多啦，但别的工作室三周才能完成一半的任务，我一周就能搞定。这可不是在吹牛哦。","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/nq2iftnxwckc0f1yda6khnxr5xz4l9m.mp3","text":"我做研究的时候千万别打扰我，我是会让咪波咬你的！我自己也会！","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3f/rsr09gamqtcu7ruwo31wftt6pierwbd.mp3","text":"晚上总是会很有灵感呢......但又......非常困！不，不行了，枕头在哪......我要休息一下......","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/72/6v98yi3jr8zxk5rq9r4290l41k6bqmh.mp3","text":"嗯？你想问为什么它们叫咪波？咪波是它的启动音效嘛，我觉得挺合适的。不像？那你可以摁下这个开关——等等！不是那个！那是自毁———呜啊啊啊，快跑！！","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:3/39/4ut78ta6rh9eykok40vb3vua298sls3.mp3","text":"刚刚走过去的......是赫默吧。如果那时候......喔，抱歉，保密协议还没过期，我不该多嘴的。","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/96/3yvkvfddrr4teljrj1k978fp5u7ck8q.mp3","text":"闲下来就只会感到空虚呢......工程师就是这样的人啦。博士也会无所事事吗？不会？","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/7inn5rl4t0s9zw6b27d8hmy2pjnappq.mp3","text":"博士，我能申请——不是！不用十平米！上次是我不对，这回——三平米就够了！别，别跑啊博士！一平米实用科研面积也行！求你了！","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6b/3lyfigvlcgylev4u98f4d7n3hpigqv7.mp3","text":"哈啊......咖啡机在哪里......呼，博士你也要来点儿吗","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/ihz7p8yqf5xo31cplt3uqg5axvo0234.mp3","text":"莱茵生命所属，鲁特拉工作室，竭诚为您服务。是的，没有其他成员，我一人就是整个工作室。很厉害吧！","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:4/45/p3p9yjbc9u86q2ywug9esf31rp0dnld.mp3","text":"这个结构——有些意思，我得研究一下。","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/58buw18afeav7v48g1hdi378234e991.mp3","text":"这次涨薪可真是及时，我又能升级一下设备了。","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/i25elcq1i97hhn7u46ur13y4e8ct68y.mp3","text":"我向您保证过一定能出成果，现在，怎么样，是不是很令人满意呀~","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/m5ko9f0ifqp640cw7lh97fjve8f22ix.mp3","text":"咪波们，该上场咯！","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d9/f7txyz4z2ciiyv7aqu1njbjborw3hct.mp3","text":"要同时指挥大家和咪波，就算是我也有点手忙脚乱......！","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/jduhf6i88glaqqtsy4ctlyxzb4ezk2a.mp3","text":"这次也能得到良好的实验数据吧！","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5b/f1wpq86xzrsi061dg4crg9vqonpoxyr.mp3","text":"上吧咪波，给敌人看看我们莱茵生命的技术力！","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:6/61/elvnkbwqyp1oomqo2xged4ozezaxzd3.mp3","text":"呜哇！","alt":"voice/char_242_otter/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/qn2ksokfrv258c4vtcntcpqme8jzp